Theres 3 package formats you should watch out for :

<A> IPS the default packaging format for OpenSolaris
    packagemanager
    pkg install -i SUNWname

<b> Blastwave
    This probably has the most packages out there
    Use pfexec perl /opt/csw/bin/pkgutil -i[r] name

<c> Sunfreeware
    pkg-get should work or you can download from their site and do pkg-add -d filename


